I'm back in the dungeons again - trying to apply some of the things 
I've learned - and had a couple of funny things happen in the mines.

In minetown I got attacked by a large cat.  I tamed it, and then next 
thing you know it turned into a jabberwock.  Turns out it was a 
chameleon.  So, it was kind of fun that if a chameleon just happens to 
be a cat, dog, etc. then it can be tamed.  Sadly, the chameleon and my 
real pet cat didn't last much longer after that.

Later, I think on level 9 in the mines, I ran into a baluchitherium.  
Good grief!  They cause a lot of damage.  I was easily clearing out 
everything else and I could barely stay alive more than two or three 
turns with the baluchitherium.  I had to keep escaping up the stairs 
and recouping.

